      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that helps! I\u2019m also wondering about calcium\u2014how much should I be consuming each day as a 25-year-old woman?",
          "user_rubrik": "How much calcium should I consume daily as a 25 year-old woman?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "As a 25-year-old woman, you should aim for approximately 1,000 milligrams of calcium per day. This amount is essential for maintaining strong bones and overall health. It's also important to ensure you're getting enough vitamin D to aid in calcium absorption, which can range from 200 to 600 international units daily. You can meet your calcium needs through dairy products, leafy greens, and fortified foods, or consider supplements if necessary.",
