      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great, thanks. Which of these\u2014brown rice, quinoa, cauliflower rice, or black rice\u2014has the most and least calories per serving?",
          "user_rubrik": "How much calories do brown rice, quinoa, cauliflower rice, and black rice have?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "In terms of calories per serving, here's how they compare:\n\n- **Brown Rice**: Approximately 250 calories per cup cooked.\n- **Quinoa**: About 222 calories per cup cooked.\n- **Black Rice**: Roughly 200 calories per cup cooked.\n- **Cauliflower Rice**: Only about 25 calories per cup.\n\nSo, cauliflower rice has the least calories, while brown rice has the most. If you're looking for lower-calorie options, cauliflower rice is an excellent choice!",
          "citations": {
