          "user_utterance": "I'd love some tips for making my breakfasts healthier. Any ideas?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I have more healthy breakfasts?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For a healthier breakfast, consider options that align with your preferences for nutrient-dense, high-protein, and low-carb meals while addressing your calcium concerns. Greek yogurt is an excellent choice\u2014it\u2019s high in protein, low in carbs, and rich in calcium. You can pair it with berries and almonds for added nutrients and flavor. Smoothies are another versatile option; blend Greek yogurt with spinach or kale, a handful of berries, and a scoop of protein powder for a calcium-boosting, low-carb drink. Eggs are also a fantastic choice\u2014try scrambling them with spinach for a quick, nutrient-packed meal. If you\u2019re on the go, a ready-to-drink protein shake with added calcium can be a convenient option. These ideas will help you start your day with a balanced, satisfying meal.",
