          "text": "For high-protein, nutrient-dense, low-carb snacks that also boost calcium\u2014perfect for your goals\u2014focus on these options:\n\n**Top Snack Picks:**\n- **Low-Fat Dairy:** String cheese, cottage cheese, Greek yogurt (plain), and Swiss or provolone cheese are all high in protein and calcium, but low in carbs. Always choose plain or unflavored to avoid added sugars (clueweb22-en0015-15-04713, clueweb22-en0046-73-06617).\n- **Eggs:** Hard-boiled eggs are nearly zero-carb, rich in protein, and portable (clueweb22-en0003-71-10689, clueweb22-en0017-13-08943).\n- **Nuts & Seeds:** Almonds, walnuts, and pumpkin seeds are filling, provide protein, healthy fats, and some calcium, and are low in carbs (clueweb22-en0004-42-06445, clueweb22-en0044-75-15669).\n- **Protein Bars/Shakes:** Look",
