          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Even if you don't like to cook, you can still create a cook-at-home routine. Start by setting aside a specific time each day or week to cook, and begin with simple recipes that require minimal ingredients and preparation. You can also prep ingredients in advance to make cooking faster and easier. Consider meal planning and making a grocery list to help you stay organized and focused. Remember, the goal is",
