          "user_rubrik": "How can I have more healthy breakfasts?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For a healthier breakfast, consider adding protein-rich foods like eggs, yogurt, milk, cheese, and lean meats. You can also include whole grains like whole wheat bread, oats, and quinoa. Fresh fruits and nuts are great sources of fiber and healthy fats. Try to limit sugary and refined carbohydrates like white bread, sugary cereals, and pastries. A balanced breakfast with a combination of protein, healthy fats, and complex carbohydrates can help keep you full and satisfied until lunchtime. You can also experiment with different combinations of foods to find what works best for you.",
