          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. I prefer foods with more nutrients and protein.",
            "2. I am interested in low-carb food.",
            "3. I think I don't get enough calcium, and I am worried about it.",
            "4. I eat jam for breakfast.",
            "5. I like the taste of white bread."
