          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for ideas to make my breakfasts healthier. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I have more healthy breakfasts?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For healthier, low-carb, high-protein, and calcium-rich breakfasts, consider Greek yogurt. It's an excellent source of protein and calcium, and you can mix it with berries and almonds for a filling meal. Smoothies are another great option; blend Greek yogurt with berries or other low-carb fruits, and even add spinach for extra nutrients. Eggs are also a versatile, high-protein, low-carb choice. You could also try cottage cheese for protein and calcium, or chia seed pudding.",
