          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Here are approximate calories for cooked, plain (no oil) servings:  Per 1 cup cooked - Brown rice: 215\u2013220 kcal - Quinoa: 220\u2013225 kcal - Cauliflower rice: 20\u201330 kcal (steamed/saut\u00e9ed without oil) - Black rice (forbidden rice): 200\u2013215 kcal  Per 1/2 cup cooked - Brown rice: ~108\u2013110 kcal - Quinoa: ~111 kcal - Cauliflower rice: ~10\u201315 kcal - Black rice: ~100\u2013108 kcal  Note: Saut\u00e9ing adds about 40\u2013120 kcal per tablespoon of oil. If you want to lower calories (and carbs) while keeping volume, try half regular rice and half cauliflower rice.",
