          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking for ways to make my breakfasts healthier. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I have more healthy breakfasts?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "great \u2014 try these simple, practical swaps and habits : - prioritize protein + fiber : add eggs, greek yogurt, cottage cheese, tofu, or nut butter to keep you full. - choose whole grains : steel - cut oats, overnight oats, whole - grain toast, or whole - wheat pancakes. - bulk up with produce : toss spinach / berries into smoothies, top oats with fruit, or add veggies to omelets. - add healthy fats : avocado, nuts, seeds, or a spoonful of nut butter. - smart swaps for sweets : use mashed banana, applesauce, or a little dark chocolate instead of refined sugar. - make - ahead strategies : overnight oats, chia pudding, egg muffins, or frozen breakfast sandwiches for busy mornings. - quick vegan options : green smoothies, oatmeal, simple pancakes or savory tofu scramble. - plan and prep : pick 3 go - to breakfasts, batch - cook / freezer - friendly items, and keep a short grocery list. - allow small treats intentionally \u2014 enjoy them, but keep most breakfasts nutrient - dense. want 3 tailored",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0039-88-16433:11": 27.336999893188477,
