          "text": "At age 25 you should aim for about 1,000 mg of calcium per day.   Practical tips: - That\u2019s roughly three servings of calcium-rich foods spread across the day (your body only absorbs about 300\u2013500 mg at a time).   - Examples: 1 cup milk or fortified plant milk \u2248 300 mg, a 6\u20138 oz cup of Greek yogurt \u2248 200\u2013300 mg, or a serving of firm tofu/cheese can add similar amounts.   - If you don\u2019t eat dairy, choose fortified milks, tofu, leafy greens, almonds, or consider a calcium-containing multivitamin.   - If you\u2019re thinking about a supplement, check with your healthcare provider to pick the right dose and avoid excess.",
